constant grid is list of (list of 1, 2), (list of 3, 4)
add 10 to item 1 of item 2 of grid
subtract 1 from item 2 of item 1 of grid
multiply item 1 of item 1 of grid by 7
divide item 2 of item 2 of grid by 2
say grid
repeat with r from 1 to length of grid
    repeat with c from 1 to length of item r of grid
        add r * c to item c of item r of grid
    end repeat
end repeat
say grid
